    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5f5d2ed0-69eb-5fae-a2a7-6682314e24ff" activityNameId="ad16c27a-2c4b-5255-b9af-95e9f119ff60" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium mill
Assuming that the buildings of the model mill cover an area 100 m * 200 m. The model mill is assumed to produce 490 tonnes of natural uranium in yellowcake U3O8 per year over a lifetime of 15 years. All necessary electricity is assumed to be produced on site by diesel generators.;
UUID: 360e0b56-81c3-3c92-9cb5-c8ff1780cdc6
This module includes the metal and concrete as well as the energy requirements for the construction of the model mill. Also the transport of these materials and the land use are included. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_360e0b56-81c3-3c92-9cb5-c8ff1780cdc6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
